# sigil — 16x16, the thing you collect.
#
# A four-pointed star inside a ring. Small, bright, and a hue nothing else in the arena uses, so
# counting how many are left is a glance rather than a search.
#
# Deliberately smaller than a full tile: it sits in the middle of a floor square with a clear margin,
# which is what makes a room full of them read as scattered objects rather than as a pattern.
! . = 00000000   transparent
! k = 3a2f16ff   outline
! r = 8a7434ff   ring
! g = d9b64aff   star body
! w = fff0b8ff   star core
................
